# Swift desktop (Mission Control, Tauri + Vite). Copy to `.env`.
# VITE_ vars are inlined into the webview bundle at build — publishable only.
# The app talks ONLY to the admin API over HTTP(S)/WS; tokens live in the macOS
# Keychain via the Rust keychain_* commands, never in env or on disk.

# Admin API origin. Dev default: http://localhost:3000. Point at your deployed
# API for staging/prod (must be in the API's CORS_ORIGIN allow-list).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Dev only: set to 1 to restore a saved session on launch (skips re-login while
# developing). Leave UNSET for the normal Keychain-gated sign-in.
# VITE_RESTORE_SESSION=

# Tauri dev-server host for mobile/LAN dev (optional; `tauri dev` sets it).
# TAURI_DEV_HOST=
